1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,080
AI agents can perform advanced
scientific computations,

2
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:08,460
but researchers demand transparent pricing,

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,800
explicit consent, and verified payments

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
before any paid workflow executes.

5
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:20,440
This is a caffeine crystal from the
Crystallography Open Database.

6
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:25,580
The formula-unit view displays a portion
of the loaded structure,

7
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:29,320
while the summary flags disorder
across other sites.

8
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:33,990
In the unit-cell view, overlapping
disorder components trigger clash warnings.

9
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,970
I request up to two enumerated
disorder candidates.

10
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:41,110
The MCP tool returns the method,
candidate count,

11
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:43,850
clash warnings, and the two-dollar
Sandbox price.

12
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,130
I can approve or cancel.

13
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,020
I approve the PayPal test order.

14
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:55,900
Back in MatterVis, the server verifies
payment capture before running the analysis.

15
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:59,700
I can inspect the candidate structures,
review their checks,

16
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:01,420
and download the result package.

17
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:05,160
Physical stability and the dominant
experimental configuration

18
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:07,560
still require independent validation;

19
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:11,980
these candidates serve as transparent
hypotheses for human review.
